panero (0.1.0~preview.3-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Third preview (git tag v0.1.0-preview.3).
  * Modern look: rounded panel cards, drive chip next to the path, menu
    button instead of the menu bar (Settings > Show Menubar brings it back).
  * One icon-only toolbar (22 px) with View & Colors at the right edge; a
    stale toolbar layout from an older version is replaced on upgrade.
  * Folder tree: reliable "Start at Home", click unfolds, second click folds.
  * Ctrl+wheel switches Details/Thumbnails; Space shows a folder's size.
  * View & Colors: active panel colour, Panero or Krusader selection.

